  "scope": "Unbounded functional source composition derives V/NV cache preservation for SCT insertion, pending payload update, arbitrary note-output recurrence, public nullifier batch, complete note reshape and FeeFunding raw action, across all returned errors and success. No opaque callback-domain-frame premise is supplied. This relies on the explicitly scoped successfully loaded immutable SCT model and other named representation interfaces; native/durable/full Transfer closure remains open. Verifiable and nonverifiable cache writes are derived unchanged for all returned primitive and arbitrary-list note results, including errors, from their executable object/event-only writes. No opaque callback frame is a premise. The complete note reshape and FeeFunding raw action inherit this result; earlier objects/events may remain altered on an error and are not claimed rolled back. The supplied cache can include earlier body Volume writes, which FeeFunding preserves. Actual getter panics, Clone/COW, key/value/event codecs, tree and reader semantics, fee charging outside this raw action, block finalization and participating-store durability remain distinct interfaces. Original rejected elaboration is zero credit.",
